            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1077-f4" n="4" xml:id="d1077-f4-content">
                <p>Not printed; see <ref target="#d1054-f4">footnote 4, Document 1054</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1077-f5" n="5" xml:id="d1077-f5-content">
                <p>In telegram 1637 from Cairo, Jan. 14, not printed, Ambassador Caffery described this idea as highly
                    constructive and suggested that initially the counterpart funds should be spent
                    for a 400,000 feddan reclamation project which the Egyptian Government was
                    prepared to launch shortly. (874.00 TA/1–1453)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1077-f6" n="6" xml:id="d1077-f6-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
